    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SUPER FIRST\nEVA AIR",
      "California White Wine\nST. SUPÉRY\n20011\nMERITAGE\nNAPA VALLEY WHITE WINE\nPRODUCED AND BOTTLED BY ST. SUPERY VINEYARDS \u0026 WINERY\nSt. Supery Meritage White Napa Valley 2001\nTHRa#(St. Supery Vineyards\n\u0026Winery)\n\"Méritage\" * i; FF it Méritage* *A#ta 41 •\n* *Méritage in * Semillon •\n**************\n: *******•\nThis elegant wine exhibits terrific shades of yellow with\nsome vibrant streaks of green. The aromas are tremen\n-dous with notes of passionfruit and citrus from the\nSauvignon Blanc and toasty oak complexity from the\nSemillon. The palate is crisp, vibrant and alive with\nevidence of lime and grapefruit complimented by toasty\noak contributing to this full-bodied wine with a silky\nmouthfeel and a long, lingering finish."
    ],
